<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<resources>
    <!--
        Bangla (bn) translations — PLACEHOLDER, INTENTIONALLY EMPTY.

        Add translated <string> entries here using the same name= keys as
        res/values/strings.xml. Any key not listed here automatically falls back
        to the English value, so a partial file is safe to ship.

        ============================ IMPORTANT ============================
        Do NOT translate these two arrays:

            job_statuses_customer
            job_statuses_handyman

        They are not display-only labels. The selected spinner text is compared
        against English string literals in code, for example:

            HandymanJobListFragment.kt
                "In-progress" -> Triple("assignedJobs", "acceptedJobs", "inProgressJobs")
            CustomerJobListFragment.kt
                "In-progress" -> "inProgressJobs"

        Translating them makes every one of those comparisons fail and silently
        breaks job filtering for both customers and handymen. Supporting Bangla
        here requires separating the stored value from the displayed label,
        which is a code change rather than a translation.

        Also not usually translated:
          - app_name (brand name)
          - location_array (CBD, Camberwell, Richmond, Hawthorn, Docklands are
            proper place names)
        ==================================================================
    -->
</resources>
